{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/60857c55448759bf266507cecd99cd36.avif?t=1751233917\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shroud of Gloom</strong>\u00a0combines the charm and nostalgia of classic point-and-click adventures with a chilling horror atmosphere. Explore an old manor shrouded in mystery, solve puzzles rooted in your surroundings, and uncover the secrets of this forgotten place - it may seem abandoned at first glance, but you\u2019re certain that you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1751233917\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modern Point-and-Click Gameplay</strong>: Reminiscent of the classics, but with the responsiveness and polish that you expect in modern games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration &amp; Engaging Puzzles</strong>: Rummage through the manor, find useful items and solve a variety of environmental puzzles to uncover the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Survival Horror:</strong>\u00a0Your surroundings are dark and dangerous, something is lurking around the corner, and your only chance of survival is to remain undetected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong>: An original soundtrack and handcrafted sound effects designed to immerse you into this unsettling world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1751233917\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shroud of Gloom</strong>\u00a0is a deeply personal project from two lifelong friends: one solo developer and one sound designer. It\u2019s the result of passion, persistence, and countless late nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your support means the world - wishlist now to be notified on release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1751233917\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453420?t=1751233917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751233917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/bde527f6ee9ebc2ee90ab205c05e7ed390ffdd12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751233917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/bde527f6ee9ebc2ee90ab205c05e7ed390ffdd12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751233917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453420/extras/60857c55448759bf266507cecd99cd36.avif?t=1751233917\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shroud of Gloom</strong>\u00a0combines the charm and nostalgia of classic point-and-click adventures with a chilling horror atmosphere. Explore an old manor shrouded in mystery, solve puzzles rooted in y